  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of the digital management of copyrights in developing countr</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide the means, through digital based applications, tools and documentation, for new and early stage Collective Management Organisations, CMOs, to commence operations expeditiously and efficiently using systems and practices consistent with international administration of creative copyrights.</narrative>
  </description>
